⚡🇮🇶 Iraq loads 2 million barrels of crude onto a VLCC outside the Strait of Hormuz to expand export flexibility.

Baghdad is also seeking specialized crude tankers to expand its fleet and give the State Oil Marketing Organization greater flexibility in selling exports.

@MedmanNews

⚡🇮🇹in Salerno, southern Italy, a 21-year-old university student has been arrested on charges of possessing clandestine weapons and material containing instructions for preparing explosive devices with terrorist intent. 

According to investigators, the young man had adopted the ideology of Islamic radicalism. Pistols, knives, and a machete were seized from his home.

